  "content": "<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wishful-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.postimg.cc/4xVp9RM1/wishcraft(2).png\" alt=\"此模組已整合至 Wishful Recipes。請點擊此處查看。它能自動動態生成配方，因此與其他模組高度相容，且無需過多配置。\"></a></p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/NUjMWxj.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><h5 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https://shieldsio-patreon.vercel.app/api?username=MarsThePlanet&amp;type=patrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在Patreon上支持我\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/blasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks-fabric-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/886474?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fblasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/blasting-raw-metal-blocks-into-blocks?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> </strong></h5><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>這款完全可配置的模組讓你能將整塊的未加工金屬塊冶煉成對應的金屬塊。這樣一來，從礦場回來後冶煉大量未加工礦石的速度會快上許多。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/addJ4gp.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/hD6mAuc.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ng4QLHA.png\" alt=\"\" height=\"270\"></p><p><strong>配置</strong></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>你可直接在遊戲內配置本模組，或編輯設定檔資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/blastingraw.json</code>。請注意任何變更都需要重啟 Minecraft 才會生效。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>cooking_time</strong> - 在高爐中冶煉一個未加工礦塊所需的刻數（tick）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>raw_metal_list</strong> - 未加工礦塊的清單，包含對應的冶煉成品以及冶煉時獲得的經驗值</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>works_in_furnace</strong> - 是否要在普通熔爐中生成冶煉未加工礦塊的配方（冶煉時間加倍）</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/xa9IJlI.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fdeimos\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\"></a></p>",
